<title>POLAND: KETY JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.02 vs   1.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.51 vs   3.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.88 vs   2.79</p>
<p> Sales		   42.35 vs  30.27</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.03 vs  14.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.90 vs  24.75</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.67 vs  20.52</p>
<p> Sales		  222.88 vs 185.26</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium smelter is Zaklady</p>
<p>Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
